   Martinez, Daniel Alfredo Landinez, Univ Manizales, Hlth Sci Fac, Sch Med, Manizales, Colombia.
   Arenas, David Andres Montoya, Univ Pontificia Bolivariana, Psychol Dept, Medellin, Colombia.
