   Lin, Yu-Ruei; Cheng, Yu-Hsiang; Lin, Dai-Wei; Chuang, Yu-Chen; Fuh, Jong-Ling, Taipei Vet Gen Hosp, Neurol Inst, Dept Neurol, Div Gen Neurol, 201 Sect 2,Shi Pai Rd, Taipei 112, Taiwan.
   Huang, Hsiu-ling, Natl Palace Museum, Dept Exhibit Serv, Taipei, Taiwan.
