Funding-Text = {We certify that this work has not been reported previously. To the best
   of our knowledge, no studies have comprehensively assessed associations
   between baseline pain, incident pain, and pain persistence on cognitive
   decline, especially using a comprehensive battery of tests in
   communitydwelling older adults. Our findings specifically particularly
   highlight the role of incident pain in accelerating cognitive decline in
