   Ballesteros, Soledad; Rieker, Jennifer A.; Mayas, Julia; Prieto, Antonio; Jimenez, Maria Pilar, Univ Nacl Educ Distancia, Dept Basic Psychol 2, Fac Psicol, Juan del Rosal 10, Madrid, Spain.
   Reales, Jose Manuel, Univ Nacl Educ Distancia, Dept Methodol Behav Sci, Fac Psicol, Madrid, Spain.},
