   Gross, Alden L.; Rebok, George W.; Brandt, Jason, Johns Hopkins Bloomberg Sch Publ Hlth, Dept Mental Hlth, Baltimore, MD USA.
   Unverzagt, Frederick W., Indiana Univ Sch Med, Dept Psychiat, Indianapolis, IN USA.
   Willis, Sherry L., Univ Washington, Dept Psychiat \& Behav Sci, Seattle, WA 98195 USA.
