   Liang, Ying, Nanjing Univ, Dept Social Work \& Social Policy, Nanjing, Jiangsu, Peoples R China.
   Huo, Meng, Univ Texas Austin, Dept Human Dev \& Family Sci, Austin, TX 78712 USA.
   Kennison, Robert, Calif State Univ Los Angeles, Dept Psychol, Los Angeles, CA USA.},
