   Strenziok, Maren; Parasuraman, Raja; Clarke, Ellen; Cisler, Dean S.; Thompson, James C.; Greenwood, Pamela M., George Mason Univ, Dept Psychol, Arch Lab, Fairfax, VA 22030 USA.},
